，你喝那么多冰的，半夜肚子又该抽着疼了。","roundId":"round_1783867483643_1l4x0cb3d","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7725},{"id":1783849989891,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1783867549160,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"小乖，算老公求你了，我不说了，我一句都不多嘴了，你别去……你乖乖回宿舍，或者你就在那坐着别动，我现在就去跟金教练请假，我马上打车过去找你，你别不要我……","minimaxTimbreId":"voice_zzs","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"sad","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1783867483643_1l4x0cb3d","audioDuration":15,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7726,"audioRef":378},{"id":1783849989892,"sender":"them","text":"","timestamp":1783867552308,"tempo":"N","sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/CKLvJCZ0/1780335503887.png","stickerMeaning":"咪委屈尾巴点地","rawContent":"","roundId":"round_1783867483643_1l4x0cb3d","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7727},{"id":1783849989893,"text":"你在总局待着，你要是敢过来我也出去约炮","sender":"me","time":"22:46","timestamp":1783867589579,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7728},{"id":1783849989894,"text":"被一个男人睡也是睡，被n个男人睡也是睡","sender":"me","time":"22:46","timestamp":1783867605032,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7729},{"id":1783849989896,"sender":"them","text":"杨景伊，你非要拿刀子往我心口上捅是不是？","timestamp":1783867657481,"tempo":"R","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"杨景伊，你非要拿刀子往我心口上捅是不是？","roundId":"round_1783867608711_xvjr1sx11","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7730},{"id":1783849989897,"sender":"them","text":"我不去了，我不去了行不行？我乖乖在总局待着，我哪都不去，你别去……算我求你了，你别让别人碰你。","timestamp":1783867663037,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"我不去了，我不去了行不行？我乖乖在总局待着，我哪都不去，你别去……算我求你了，你别让别人碰你。","roundId":"round_1783867608711_xvjr1sx11","userId":"uid_1782386286410