868335882,"sender":"them","text":"我已经让师傅重新往总局开了，你别生气，我乖乖回去训练。","timestamp":1783868745559,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"我已经让师傅重新往总局开了，你别生气，我乖乖回去训练。","roundId":"round_1783868695519_updn4nmkv","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7769},{"id":1783868335883,"sender":"them","text":"是，我不一样，我一碰到杨景伊就精虫上脑，我承认行了吧？","timestamp":1783868748489,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"是，我不一样，我一碰到杨景伊就精虫上脑，我承认行了吧？","roundId":"round_1783868695519_updn4nmkv","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7770},{"id":1783868335884,"sender":"them","text":"谁让你下午在床上那么乖……还叫我老公，我能忍得住才怪。","timestamp":1783868751273,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"谁让你下午在床上那么乖……还叫我老公，我能忍得住才怪。","roundId":"round_1783868695519_updn4nmkv","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7771},{"id":1783868335885,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1783868756422,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"小乖，我错了，我不回去抓你了。你别拿分手吓我，我真的受不了这个。既然是睡素觉，那就乖乖盖好被子，明天还有早八呢，赶紧睡觉，好不好？","minimaxTimbreId":"voice_zzs","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1783868695519_updn4nmkv","audioDuration":14,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7772,"audioRef":383},{"id":1783868335886,"sender":"them","text":"","timestamp":1783868757436,"tempo":"N","sticker":"https://img.baibai.cv/f/n18qFp/1782198808092.png","stickerMeaning":"我已经反省过了","rawContent":"","roundId":"round_1783868695519_updn4nmkv","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7773},{"id":1783868335887,"text":"嗯，男模手感真的不错","sender":"me","time":"23:06","timestamp":1783868810923,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":7774}]